{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:28 2026-11-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:28 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:28 2026-11-03 HKT</p><img alt=\"八鄉元崗村垃圾站烈焰衝天 消防趕至迅速救熄。FB：錦上路之友\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ff4e19f70a140e3870db6db70246549/2026-11/886744420_2222473765290405_5977008048808830603_n.jpg\"/><p>八鄉元崗村周二（11月3日）晚上10時許有多人報案，指錦上路旁的清潭垃圾站起火。現場圖片所見垃圾站烈焰衝天，途人紛紛躲避。消防接報趕至，迅速將火救熄。火警中暫無受傷報告，起火原因仍在調查；受意外影響，現場交通一度繁忙。</p><img alt=\"消防將火撲熄。fb：錦上路之友\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cd11000f1c78e1c0116eaa8d6e6f1ff1/2026-11/01_5_1.jpg\" title=\"消防將火撲熄。fb：錦上路之友\"/><p>消防將火撲熄。fb：錦上路之友</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:41:03.710962+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T15:28:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T03:38:55.344185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T16:38:40.550808+00:00","content_hash":"66dea6f0eaaf2c54e0b2590e448fb66e93e50cc8277a9110b05b2ff8eab9673f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}